        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Use a crusty round roll or a short baguette per person. The bread must be sturdy enough to hold the filling and absorb the dressing without falling apart. Drain the tuna through a sieve and press out all the oil before using." }]
